      "TEXT": "Clans Day One",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Daeron the Elder \n\u0022Escort me to the Maw, lads, and I\u0027ll make sure ye have an entrance to the heart of the Demon lands!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Norwyndar \n\u0022It won\u0027t be that easy, Daeron. We must pass through the remnants of the Govenesh forces and the growing demon army. I suggest we...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Daeron the Elder \n\u0022Why would we listen to Elf suggestions? Aye, it will be a rough road, but let\u0027s not forget who we are! We must head South at once while our enemies are weak!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Norwyndar \n\u0022We will be much better off if Daeron stays in the capital until we have built up a strong enough force to protect him. We should send a party to the southwest to investigate the Govenesh  while my group heads east to seek allies.\u0022 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Daeron the Elder \n\u0022Pah! Cowardly Elf strategies! Let us march!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Day One",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Amzin \n\u0022Sire, we\u0027ve news that the small ones are coming from the north. We could easily defend against them if we were not under attack by the Govenesh. We need to take their remaining cities at once! I have something to show you...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thriss \n\u0022Why have you brought Thrisssss here? You will not live to...ssssss....sssssss...this body is ours, sire. Weak minds are easily destroyed. I await your command.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Amzin \n\u0022Being so close to the Maw, our brethren can live long enough in this realm to possess the weak.  We have yet another soldier who wishes to join...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Grunkk \n\u0022You bring Grunkk here! Grunkk mash you into ground like...aaaaaargh...I have control of the beast now, Si....arrrgh...you not control Grunkk! Wait...there. As I was saying, we now have control of the Ogre.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Amzin \n\u0022Lose control again and we will make sure you suffer for it. Sire, if we use our...borrowed troops, we may be able to trick the nearby races into fighting for us. However, I suggest we first raid the Govenesh cities.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Amzin \n\u0022Ahahah! The pathetic Dwarves have lost their savior! They have nothing left to fight for!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Daeron the Elder \n\u0022There! It is done, lads! We have a tunnel leading straight to the heart of the Legions\u0027 forces and by Wotan we\u0027ll bring the wrath of the Clans to them!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
