      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Scout \n\u0022So few of my people are left...and look at them - weak and shackled!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Relwynn \n\u0022We\u0027d given up hope. Of course we\u0027ll march upon the demons with you!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Truntis \n\u0022First you\u0027ll need to cut through our chains. The Orc slavemaster by the pit there, he has a nice little blade that should do the trick. Ah, I see you\u0027ve already found it. Thank you..\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans on the Move",
