    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Frug Brenstout \n\u0022And I thought Dwarves mixed poorly with Elves! I\u0027ve just heard Goblins have been spotted in Lizardman patrols! The native races must have joined together to survive the Govenesh onslaught...\u0022",
