    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S209EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Amzin \n\u0022We\u0027d best be alert - the native races seemed to have joined forces, most likely to avoid being slaughtered by the Govenesh. No matter, we shall slay them...alliance or no alliance.\u0022",
